---
// Fixed gradient wash. Purely decorative and token-driven, so a rebrand needs no
// change here. Own layer + translateZ keeps it off the main paint path.
---

<div class="pointer-events-none fixed inset-0 -z-10 decor" aria-hidden="true"></div>

<style>
  .decor {
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse at top left, var(--decor-from) 0%, var(--decor-mid) 40%, var(--decor-to) 100%);
    transform: translateZ(0);
  }
</style>
